to to see this community  grieving there especially because there  were so many families that were simply  grocery shopping this was a saturday  afternoon and this was such a pillar and  mainstay of the community and you just  think about how people's guards are down  in a moment like that too time and time  again jeffy said at the end there not  choosing love and you are taught hate  you are not born with it
 

